# O fires once (block placed at (3,2)): P5 extends and pushes P4 from (1,1) to (1,0); P4 never
# extends (its event finds a moving block at (1,1) and is dropped); after the pulse P5 spits P4.
design designs/gadgets/qc-shared.txt
probe p5 1 2 0
setblock 3 2 0 minecraft:stone
settle
expect_state 1 2 0 sticky_piston[extended=false
expect_state 1 1 0 air
expect_state 1 0 0 sticky_piston[extended=false
expect_state 1 -1 0 stone
